{"version":1,"content":"<p>警方新界南總區過去3日針對高利貨及非法收債，搜查一間由三合會操控的財務公司，共拘捕18人，年齡17至69歲，包括財務公司負責人，涉嫌「以過高利率貸出款項」、「沒有牌照而經營放債人業務」、「洗黑錢」、「刑事恐嚇」及「刑事毁壞」。</p><p>據了解，財務公司有黑幫「14K」背景。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.580326+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T09:48:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:17:57.374241+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"f3f6681bf72e5ddb2049038c19b8cd263bcee55a4515e30e855a2d2c43236877","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}